        "title": "JSON dalam JS",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 120523,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu sudah tahu apa itu object JS. Sekarang, mari mengenal JSON.</p><p>JSON adalah singkatan dari <strong>JavaScript Object Notation</strong>. Kita dapat menggunakan format data ini untuk bertukar data antara aplikasi web dan server.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "JSON quote",
            "id": 120529,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>JSON terlihat seperti versi <em>stringified</em> dari objek JS biasa.</p><p>Kita dapat membuat <code>jsonVariable</code> seperti object biasa <code>{}</code>, tetapi dibungkus dengan tanda kutip tunggal <code>'</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" jsonVariable = \" /><text value=\"'{}'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>'</code>, diikuti oleh <code>{</code>, lalu <code>}</code>, <code>'</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "JSON quotes",
            "id": 120524,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Objek JSON berisi kumpulan pasangan key-value, mirip dengan objek JS.</p><p>Namun, dalam JSON, kita perlu menulis key di antara tanda kutip, seperti <code>\"times\"</code> di sini.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" jsonString = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;story&quot;: &quot;Life&quot;, &quot;times&quot;: 2, &quot;fiction&quot;: true }'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"44\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>times</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Objek JSON berisi kumpulan pasangan key-value, mirip dengan objek JS.</p><p>Key JSON memerlukan tanda kutip ganda, seperti <code>\"story\"</code>. Lengkapi key <code>times</code> untuk nilai <code>2</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" jsonString = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;story&quot;: &quot;Life&quot;, &quot;times&quot;: 2, &quot;fiction&quot;: true }'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"'\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"fiction\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>times</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "JSON data types",
            "id": 120525,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Objek JSON dapat mengumpulkan data statis seperti Number, Array, Boolean, atau String. Namun, objek JSON <strong>tidak dapat</strong> menyimpan fungsi di dalamnya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" story = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;story&quot;: &quot;Life&quot;,&quot;times&quot;: 2,&quot;fiction&quot;: true}'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function(){}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Objek JSON dapat mengumpulkan data statis seperti Number, Array, Boolean, atau String. Namun, objek JSON <strong>tidak dapat</strong> menyimpan fungsi di dalamnya.</p><p>Lengkapi string JSON agar <code>fiction</code> memiliki nilai boolean <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" story = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;story&quot;: &quot;Life&quot;,&quot;times&quot;: 2,&quot;fiction&quot;: true}'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function() {}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"fiction\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "JSON vs JS object",
            "id": 120526,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa tipe data berikut?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" rainbow = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"colors\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": [\" /><text value=\"&quot;red&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;orange&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;yellow&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;green&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;blue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;purple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"],\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"rain\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sebuah object JS</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">JSON</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sebuah object JS.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu membungkus nilai yang ditetapkan ke <code>rainbow</code> dengan tanda kutip tunggal tanpa mengubah isinya. Apakah ini JSON yang valid?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" rainbow = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"colors\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": [\" /><text value=\"&quot;red&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;orange&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;yellow&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;green&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;blue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;purple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"],\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"rain\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tidak, key juga memerlukan tanda kutip ganda.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ya, menambahkan tanda kutip di bagian luar sudah cukup.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tidak, JSON tidak dapat berisi array.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Tidak, key juga memerlukan tanda kutip ganda.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "JSON Stringify",
            "id": 120527,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita dapat mengonversi objek JS menjadi JSON dengan metode <code>JSON.stringify()</code>.</p><p>Di sini kita dapat mengonversi objek JS <code>concert</code> menjadi objek JSON jika kita menggunakan <code>JSON.stringify(concert)</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" concert = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"band\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Super Carrots&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"music\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Indie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(concert);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"JSON\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".stringify(concert));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"117\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{ band: 'Super Carrots', music: 'Indie' }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"{&quot;band&quot;:&quot;Super Carrots&quot;,&quot;music&quot;:&quot;Indie&quot;}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>JSON</code>, diikuti oleh <code>stringify</code>, dan terakhir <code>concert</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita dapat mengonversi objek JS menjadi JSON dengan metode <code>JSON.stringify()</code>.</p><p>Lebih tepatnya, <code>JSON.stringify()</code> mengembalikan string berformat JSON.</p><p>Ubah seluruh object menjadi string JSON untuk output console kedua.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" concert = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"band\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Super Carrots&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"music\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Indie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(concert);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"JSON\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".stringify(concert));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"117\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"parse\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"object\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"music\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{ band: 'Super Carrots', music: 'Indie' }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"{&quot;band&quot;:&quot;Super Carrots&quot;,&quot;music&quot;:&quot;Indie&quot;}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>JSON</code>, diikuti oleh <code>stringify</code>, dan terakhir <code>concert</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "JSON parse",
            "id": 120528,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita juga dapat mengubah string JSON menjadi objek JS dengan metode <code>JSON.parse()</code>.</p><p>Jika kita menyertakan <code>dog</code> di dalam tanda kurung, kita akan mengubah string JSON menjadi objek JS.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" dog = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Rocko&quot;,&quot;age&quot;:3}'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"JSON\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".parse(dog));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"66\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{ name: 'Rocko', age: 3 }\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>JSON</code>, diikuti oleh <code>parse</code>, dan terakhir <code>dog</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita juga dapat mengubah string JSON menjadi objek JS dengan metode <code>JSON.parse()</code>.</p><p>Ubah string JSON yang tersimpan menjadi object JS dan tampilkan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" dog = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Rocko&quot;,&quot;age&quot;:3}'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"JSON\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".parse(dog));\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"stringify\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"name\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"age\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{ name: 'Rocko', age: 3 }\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>JSON</code>, diikuti oleh <code>parse</code>, dan terakhir <code>dog</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: json.stringify",
            "id": 120530,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana cara mengonversi objek JS menjadi string JSON?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dengan <code>JSON.stringify</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dengan <code>JSON.parse</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dengan <code>JSON.stringify</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu memiliki objek JavaScript dan harus mengirim isinya sebagai string JSON. Method konversi mana yang menjalankan arah tersebut?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dengan <code>JSON.stringify</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dengan <code>JSON.parse</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Dengan <code>JSON.object</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Dengan <code>JSON.stringify</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Q: JSON.stringify",
            "id": 120531,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang akan ditampilkan console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" birthday = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"attendees\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"dressCode\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"JSON\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".stringify(birthday));\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{&quot;attendees&quot;:13,&quot;dressCode&quot;:false}\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>{\"attendees\": 13, \"dressCode\": false}</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>{attendees: 13, dressCode : false}</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>{\"attendees\": 13, \"dressCode\": false}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu mengubah <code>dressCode</code> menjadi <code>true</code> sebelum menjalankan kode. Apa yang sekarang ditampilkan console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" birthday = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"attendees\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"dressCode\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"JSON\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".stringify(birthday));\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{&quot;attendees&quot;:13,&quot;dressCode&quot;:false}\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>{\"attendees\":13,\"dressCode\":true}</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>{\"attendees\":13,\"dressCode\":false}</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>{\"attendees\":13,\"dressCode\":\"true\"}</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>{\"attendees\":13,\"dressCode\":true}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: JSON strings",
            "id": 120532,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi JSON berikut.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" charity = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;name&quot;: &quot;bestHelp&quot;, &quot;donors&quot;: 123 }'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>'</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"</code>, lalu <code>\"</code>, <code>'</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi JSON berikut. Pertahankan seluruh objek di dalam satu string JavaScript dan beri tanda kutip pada key-nya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" charity = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;name&quot;: &quot;bestHelp&quot;, &quot;donors&quot;: 123 }'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"`\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"donors\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"bestHelp\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>'</code>, diikuti oleh <code>name</code>, <code>\"</code>, <code>\"</code>, dan terakhir <code>'</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: JSON.parse",
            "id": 120533,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>*<em>Parse</em> string JSON <code>brochure</code> sehingga kita melihat objek JS dalam output konsol.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" brochure = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;title&quot;: &quot;Summer Vacation&quot;, &quot;destination&quot;:&quot;France&quot;}'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" parsedBrochure = \" /><text value=\"JSON\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".parse(brochure);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(parsedBrochure);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"106\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{ title: 'Summer Vacation', destination: 'France' }\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>parse</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
